sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Patient as Paciente
    participant UI as Frontend Paciente
    participant API as FastAPI /consultations
    participant Store as InMemoryStore
    participant TRIAGE as triage_engine
    participant RAG as rag_service
    participant KB as Clinical Guidelines

    Patient->>UI: Completa sintomas y contexto
    UI->>API: POST /consultations
    API->>Store: create_consultation(payload)
    Store-->>API: ConsultationRecord (SUBMITTED)
    API-->>UI: Consulta creada

    UI->>API: POST /consultations/{id}/triage
    API->>Store: get_consultation(id)
    Store-->>API: ConsultationRecord
    API->>TRIAGE: evaluate_consultation(consultation)
    TRIAGE->>RAG: retrieve(query_terms)
    RAG->>KB: Cargar y rankear documentos
    KB-->>RAG: Evidencia clinica top-k
    RAG-->>TRIAGE: evidence_sources
    TRIAGE-->>API: triage_result + recommendation
    API->>Store: save_triage(id, triage_result, recommendation)
    Store-->>API: ConsultationRecord (RECOMMENDED/ESCALATED)
    API-->>UI: Resultado con severidad, decision y fuentes
